{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Brainrot Royale! Fight with the greatest brainrot characters to the death in Ohio in the ultimate Gen Z showdown. Embrace chaos and claim your crown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brainrot Battle Royale is a 16 player battle royale experience, where you must fight for survival on the island of Ohio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parachute in on Bombardiro Crocodilo, loot up, and get to fighting.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated servers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person shooting mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ability system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 characters (Play as John Pork, lil Chuddy, Tung Tung Sahur, or Tim Cheese)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimate brainrot experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/extras/descss.png?t=1750476703\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448360?t=1750476703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/08ae65122878024f41949eb8add7538554e03413/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750476703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/6393c885746d98b5a50ece7b1093390431087d11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750476703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448360/6393c885746d98b5a50ece7b1093390431087d11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750476703","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"